    <figure class="fig"><div class="frame"><video src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/a9065e15010845ebb0eb10a19855f75d.mp4?width=1400" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video></div></figure>
    <p>You take it by mouth, so the compounds come out through your skin and sweat — covering your whole body, no patch missed.</p>
    <p>And the <strong>carvacrol in oregano can even kill ticks on contact</strong> — something no spray does.</p>
    <div class="r-link">👉 <a href="https://pinemoor.co/products/double-potency-upgrade-ultimate-tick-protection-1-bottle?view=pinemoor-v2">Change what ticks smell</a></div>
    <div class="break"><span>· · ·</span></div>
