    <figure class="fig"><div class="frame"><img src="{{ 'pm-amish-family-in-garden-vintage-pho-30a28.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="An Amish family tending their garden." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="902"></div></figure>
    <p>Long before chemical bug sprays, Amish families worked their fields and gardens from dawn to dusk in heavy tick country &mdash; leaning on the very same garden herbs to keep the bugs off.</p>
    <p>Pinemoor bottles that old-world wisdom, at modern concentrations, in a pure maple syrup base.</p>
    <div class="r-link">👉 <a href="https://pinemoor.co/products/double-potency-upgrade-ultimate-tick-protection-1-bottle?view=pinemoor-v2">The old way, done right</a></div>
    <div class="break"><span>· · ·</span></div>
    <h2><span class="num">Reason 5</span>In lab testing, they beat DEET, permethrin, and picaridin.</h2>
    <figure class="fig chart"><div class="frame">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 600 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Tick repellency chart" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif">
